\[f=p_{0}[1+2p_{1}\cos(2\psi_{2})+2p_{2}sin(2\psi_{2})] \tag{6.6}\]

where \(p_{0}\), \(p_{1}\) and \(p_{2}\) are free parameters. Small values of parameters \(p_{1}\) and \(p_{2}\) indicate that event plane distributions are flat. The other higher order event plane (\(\psi_{3}\), \(\psi_{4}\), \(\psi_{5}\)) distributions are shown in Figure 6.3.

